 349:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Xspi/Spi/IfxXspi_Spi.c **** 
 350:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Xspi/Spi/IfxXspi_Spi.c ****             // for Rx only, should we send a dummy byte i.e write dummy byte to DR?
