1396:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * 1. Configure the Ramp oscillator (RAMPCON UFL, SZ, WAIT) for the desired Sys PLL frequency (450M
1397:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * 2. Configure the Sys PLL and Per PLL dividers (N, P, K2/K3/K4) to desired frequencies (450MHz).
1398:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * 3. For Sys PLL,  the K2 divider be the final value i.e  direct jump to final PLL value
1399:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * 4. For Per PLL,  the K3/K4 divider be the final value
1400:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * 5. Configure the peripheral Dividers (SYS/PERCCUCONx) to desired values.
1401:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * 6. Once the RAMPCON reaches the desired freq (FSTAT = AtTop), and SYSPLL then switch CLKSELS to 
